---
---`DELETE /api/v1/{host}/{project}/trails/{trailId}/discussions/{discussionId}/messages/{messageId}`
---@param input entire.project_trails.DeleteProjectDiscussionMessageRequest
---@return entire.project_trails.DeleteProjectDiscussionMessageResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_project_discussion_message(input) end

