---Update a project Trail discussion
---
---Updates a discussion title or resolves/reopens it. Requires project management or stored-scope repository push, and containment under the addressed Trail. Accepts optional If-Match against the discussion's own ETag, returning 412 on mismatch; leaves the parent metadata ETag unchanged.
---
---`PATCH /api/v1/{host}/{project}/trails/{trailId}/discussions/{discussionId}`
---@param input entire.project_trails.UpdateProjectDiscussionRequest
---@return entire.project_trails.DiscussionUpdateResponseBody? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_project_discussion(input) end

---Edit a project Trail discussion message
---
---Edits a discussion message. Requires project management or stored-scope repository push, message authorship, and containment under both the addressed Trail and discussion; denied and unknown messages return 404. Optional If-Match uses the message's own ETag; mismatches return 412.
---
---`PATCH /api/v1/{host}/{project}/trails/{trailId}/discussions/{discussionId}/messages/{messageId}`
---@param input entire.project_trails.UpdateProjectDiscussionMessageRequest
---@return entire.project_trails.TrailDiscussionMessageResponseBody? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_project_discussion_message(input) end

---Update a project trail
---
---Updates shared intent, metadata, or lifecycle fields for project managers or writers on any repository in the current stored scope. An automation may write with write_trails in place of push, but cannot supply assignees. Only project managers may supply repoIds; proposed scope never authorizes a write. Scope-only writers are fenced against concurrent scope changes even without If-Match. Manager updates remain optionally conditional through If-Match.
---
---`PATCH /api/v1/{host}/{project}/trails/{trailId}`
---@param input entire.project_trails.UpdateProjectTrailRequest
---@return entire.project_trails.TrailResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_project_trail(input) end

return Module
